Notifications: Kaman's, where it shows them

Kaman, ArashOS's own shell, is the session's notification server where
it's installed (shell/notifications in arashos-shell): its pop-ups, its
list behind the bar's bell, Do not disturb. Only one program may own the
notification bus name, and whichever starts first would win, so this one
stays off the bus when arashos-shell's drop-in for arashos-shell.service
sets ARASHOS_KAMAN_NOTIFICATIONS=1. Caelestia's list, sidebar and lock
screen then have nothing to show.

--- a/services/Notifs.qml
+++ b/services/Notifs.qml
@@ -81,25 +81,32 @@ Singleton {
         reloadableId: "notifs"
     }
 
-    NotificationServer {
-        id: server
-
-        keepOnReload: false
-        actionsSupported: true
-        bodyHyperlinksSupported: true
-        bodyImagesSupported: true
-        bodyMarkupSupported: true
-        imageSupported: true
-        persistenceSupported: true
-
-        onNotification: notif => {
-            notif.tracked = true;
-
-            const comp = notifComp.createObject(root, {
-                popup: root.shouldShowPopup(),
-                notification: notif
-            });
-            root.list = [comp, ...root.list];
+    // ArashOS: where Kaman shows the notifications (arashos-shell sets
+    // ARASHOS_KAMAN_NOTIFICATIONS=1 for this service), it owns the
+    // notification server and this one stays off the bus.
+    LazyLoader {
+        active: Quickshell.env("ARASHOS_KAMAN_NOTIFICATIONS") !== "1"
+
+        NotificationServer {
+            id: server
+
+            keepOnReload: false
+            actionsSupported: true
+            bodyHyperlinksSupported: true
+            bodyImagesSupported: true
+            bodyMarkupSupported: true
+            imageSupported: true
+            persistenceSupported: true
+
+            onNotification: notif => {
+                notif.tracked = true;
+
+                const comp = notifComp.createObject(root, {
+                    popup: root.shouldShowPopup(),
+                    notification: notif
+                });
+                root.list = [comp, ...root.list];
+            }
         }
     }
 
